# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — NEVER commit these.
#
# The golden-test input (cell_ID_pooled_median_row_plate_standardization_cid.txt)
# is ~3.7 GB. It lives in the Zenodo dataset and is referenced by DOI in the
# README, never carried in git history:
#   https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17951792
#
# Small committed fixtures for CI belong in tests/fixtures/, which is NOT ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
*.txt.gz
*.tsv.gz

# Large tabular data anywhere except the test fixtures
*.txt
*.tsv
*.csv
!tests/fixtures/**
!examples/**
!requirements*.txt

# Pipeline outputs
results/
output/
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
!examples/**/*.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local working material
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
.log/
archive/
scratch/

